## Context
Audit B6 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). aedist `scripts/quickpr.sh` opens chore PRs with forge
auto-merge, including `tickets/` and `.claude/`. Harness `git.md`: a direct
forge merge silently skips `**Ticket:**` close claims.

## Decision needed
Recommended: quickpr refuses a PR that carries a `**Ticket:**` close claim (or
runs `erg close` in the commit itself). Alternatives: retire quickpr; keep as is.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Author decision logged here
- [ ] quickpr cannot drop a close claim silently
